, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le12ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=strong>Adam:</span> Martina! I certainly didn't expect to bump into you here. <br><span class=strong>Martina:</span> Boris, it's so great to see you! <br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Umm, I'm not Bo \u2026<br><span class=strong>Martina:</span> I have an embarrassing admission to make. After having received your business card, I went straight home and googled you!<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Well that's very flattering, but I should tell you that my name is actu \u2026<br><span class=strong>Martina:</span> \u2026 and I've got to say, having read your profile, I really do think that the universe just wants us to be together. Even the name, Boris. That was my grandfather's name! It's because of the name, really, that I knew we were destined to meet again.<br>", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le12ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "36000", "text": "<span class=strong>Boris:</span> Actually I am \u2026\n<br>\n<span class=strong>Adam:</span> Be cool, Adam. Don't ruin this for me.<br><span class=strong>Boris:</span> I am Adam?<br><span class=strong>Martina:</span> Hi Adam, nice to meet you.<br><span class=strong>Boris:</span> But I am not \u2026<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Haha, of course you're Adam. Stop messing around. He's a little bit discombobulated due to the long flight. <br><span class=strong>Boris:</span>  Okay, I am Adam and you are Boris? I just want to get it straight, you know, since apparently I'm befuddled because of a long one-hour flight.<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Now you've got it, Adam. Wow, you really are flustered today.<br><span class=strong>Martina:</span> Well, having cleared that up, let's talk about how we can arrange to bump into each other again, Boris. Maybe tonight, for drinks?<br><span class=strong>Boris:</span> I love drinks!<br/><span class=strong>Adam:</span> She's talking to me, Adam.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le12ob06re2img07.jpg"}, {"time": "79000", "text": "<span class=strong>Boris:</span> Oh, right. I guess I'm still not thinking straight, having just completed an epic 60-minute voyage. You know how it is.<br><span class=strong>Martina:</span> Umm, not really ...<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Anyway, drinks would be lovely.<br><span class=strong>Martina:</span> Wait, I just noticed. Why does your name tag say Adam, Boris?<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Oh, oops, look at that. I must have grabbed the wrong one, owing to all of the confusion in the reception area.\n<br>\n<span class=strong>Boris:</span> But there was no confusion at all in the reception \u2026<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> We've got to run, see you tonight!<br>", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le12ob06re2img06.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le12ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le12ob06re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}